    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853060/extras/b97c3650c68e2b61b76b4b302668ec28.avif?t=1753419429\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chinese Survival Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a former TV journalist who ventures alone into a coastal village in southern China to rescue her kidnapped daughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village is under the control of an illicit faction, while a strange parasitic lifeform quietly breeds in the shadows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore. Investigate. Survive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge scarce resources, solve puzzles, and face mutated horrors.<br>Every shot must be a careful decision\u2014manage your limited ammo and stamina wisely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Oppressive Atmosphere \u2022 Slow-Burning Tension</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confined spaces \u00d7 Isolated combat \u00d7 Relentless dread.<br>A tribute to classic survival horror, focusing on cinematic storytelling and emotional immersion.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853060/extras/b97c3650c68e2b61b76b4b302668ec28.avif?t=1753419429\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chinese Survival Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a former TV journalist who ventures alone into a coastal village in southern China to rescue her kidnapped daughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village is under the control of an illicit faction, while a strange parasitic lifeform quietly breeds in the shadows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore. Investigate. Survive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge scarce resources, solve puzzles, and face mutated horrors.<br>Every shot must be a careful decision\u2014manage your limited ammo and stamina wisely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Oppressive Atmosphere \u2022 Slow-Burning Tension</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confined spaces \u00d7 Isolated combat \u00d7 Relentless dread.<br>A tribute to classic survival horror, focusing on cinematic storytelling and emotional immersion.</p>",
    "short_description": "In 2003, a southern TV journalist exposed an illegal chemical spill and was forced to resign. Two years later, her daughter is kidnapped and taken to the same coastal village\u2014now abandoned and overtaken by a strange lifeform. She must face horror to find her child.",
